  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kisili Emergency Rapid Response Mechanism Project  Phase 6</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Protection, Assistance et Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">La fourniture d&apos;une protection efficace, d&apos;une assistance et de solutions durables aux r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s, aux personnes d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es &#xe0; l&apos;int&#xe9;rieur de leur propre pays (PDI) et aux autres victimes de conflits et de catastrophes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This award will provide financial support to CRS for a program entitled, kisili emergency rapid response mechanism project  phase 6 in Mali. The theory of change is if communities in crisis have increased access to sufficient quantity and quality of daily food, the means to avoid WASH-related disease transmission, safe and dignified shelter, and humanitarian assistance is better coordinated, then the affected communities will survive.  the total number of participants that will be supported under this award is 56,000.</narrative>
  </description>
